  "description": "The Turi was designed to create the ultimate low maintenance, low hassle, all day, comfort bicycle for lifestyle riders. Light commuters, weekend riders, and cruisers can feel confident in and on their bicycle with the Turi's high quality components and accessible design that keeps riders upright, safe, and prepared for rides ranging from short urban stop and go to touring on flat bike paths or rolling hills.\n\nFeaturing a seamlessly shifting Enviolo hub, the Turi can go up and down hills effortlessly with a simple twist of the wrist, free of any gear confusion. The industry-leading, carbon fiber tensile cord reinforced Gates Carbon Drive belt lasts longer than a chain and never needs oil or grease. Dual piston hydraulic disc brakes help you stop with confidence while the puncture-resistant tires go the distance.\nPriority's customer-direct model enables you to experience the Turi, and all of its industry-leading features, at an unmatched price.\nPSA: Most bicycles are selling out before they are produced. If you are looking to purchase a bicycle, we encourage you to back-order early. Our individual product pages reflect the most accurate back-order and ship dates for each model. These dates are updated in real-time for future purchases, and we generally sell out of most models before the date posted. Secure your ship date with a back-order, which can be cancelled at any time for a full refund before your bicycle ships.",
